<h1>Migration guide (v1 → v2) <span class='chip chip--danger'>v1 retired</span></h1>
<p>v1 reached end of life on 2026-08-01 alongside the <a href="/changelog">webhooks GA changelog entry</a>. This guide covers the three breaking changes you need to handle to move a v1 integration to v2.</p>

<h2>1. Pagination: offset → cursor</h2>
<p>v1 used <code>page</code>/<code>per_page</code> query parameters. v2 uses an opaque <code>cursor</code> and <code>next_cursor</code> — see <a href="/api/rate-limits-errors">Limits, quotas & errors</a> for the exact envelope.</p>

<div class='code-block'>
  <div class='code-block__header'>
    <span class='code-block__filename'>diff</span>
    <span class='code-block__lang'>diff</span>
    <button class='code-block__copy' type='button'>Copy</button>
  </div>
  <pre class='code-block__pre'><code class='code-block__code'>- GET /v1/pipelines?page=2&per_page=20
